  "math_structure": {
    "type": "cauchy_euler_nonhomogeneous_ode",
    "template": "$x^2y''+pxy'+qy=f(x)$，通过 $x=e^t$ 化为常系数方程 $y''+py'+qy=g(t)$",
    "variable_count": 4
  },
  "difficulty": 4,
  "answer": [
    {
      "label": "化为常系数微分方程与求解",
      "steps": [
        "**变量替换**：令 $x=e^t$，即 $t=\\ln x$，设 $z(t)=y(x(t))=y(e^t)$",
        "**第一阶导数变换**：$\\frac{dz}{dt}=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\frac{dx}{dt}=\\frac{dy}{dx}\\cdot e^t=x\\frac{dy}{dx}$，故 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{dz}{dt}$",
        "**第二阶导数变换**：$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{d}{dx}\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{dz}{dt}\\right)=-\\frac{1}{x^2}\\frac{dz}{dt}+\\frac{1}{x}\\cdot\\frac{d}{dt}\\left(\\frac{dz}{dt}\\right)\\cdot\\frac{dt}{dx}=-\\frac{1}{x^2}\\frac{dz}{dt}+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}$",
        "**代入原方程**：$x^2\\left(-\\frac{1}{x^2}\\frac{dz}{dt}+\\frac{1}{x^2}\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}\\right)+2x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{dz}{dt}-6z=10x^2$",
        "**化简**：$-\\frac{dz}{dt}+\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}+2\\frac{dz}{dt}-6z=10e^{2t}$，即 $\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}+\\frac{dz}{dt}-6z=10e^{2t}$",
        "**求齐次解**：齐次方程 $\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}+\\frac{dz}{dt}-6z=0$，特征方程 $r^2+r-6=0$，分解 $(r+3)(r-2)=0$，得 $r_1=-3, r_2=2$",
        "**齐次通解**：$z_h=C_1e^{-3t}+C_2e^{2t}$",
        "**求特解**：因为 $e^{2t}$ 是齐次解的一部分，设特解 $z_p=Ate^{2t}$",
        "**计算导数**：$\\frac{dz_p}{dt}=Ae^{2t}+2Ate^{2t}=A(1+2t)e^{2t}$，$\\frac{d^2z_p}{dt^2}=2Ae^{2t}+A(2+4t)e^{2t}=A(4+4t)e^{2t}$",
        "**代入方程**：$A(4+4t)e^{2t}+A(1+2t)e^{2t}-6Ate^{2t}=10e^{2t}$",
        "**比较系数**：$A[(4+4t)+(1+2t)-6t]e^{2t}=10e^{2t}$，$A[5+6t-6t]e^{2t}=10e^{2t}$，$5Ae^{2t}=10e^{2t}$，得 $A=2$",
        "**特解**：$z_p=2te^{2t}$",
        "**通解（关于t）**：$z(t)=C_1e^{-3t}+C_2e^{2t}+2te^{2t}$",
        "**回代原变量**：$y(x)=C_1e^{-3\\ln x}+C_2e^{2\\ln x}+2\\ln x\\cdot e^{2\\ln x}=C_1x^{-3}+C_2x^2+2x^2\\ln x$",
        "**最终答案**：$y=\\frac{C_1}{x^3}+C_2x^2+2x^2\\ln x$，其中 $C_1, C_2$ 为任意常数",
        "**验证**：对 $y=\\frac{C_1}{x^3}+C_2x^2+2x^2\\ln x$ 求一、二阶导数并代入原方程验证恒成立 ✓"
      ]
    }
  ],
