          "steps": [
            "令 $x=e^t$，$z(t)=y(e^t)$，则 $\\frac{dy}{dx}=\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{dz}{dt}$，$\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}=\\frac{1}{x^2}\\left(\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}-\\frac{dz}{dt}\\right)$",
            "代入原方程：$x^2\\cdot\\frac{1}{x^2}\\left(\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}-\\frac{dz}{dt}\\right)-x\\cdot\\frac{1}{x}\\frac{dz}{dt}+z=0$",
            "化简：$\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}-\\frac{dz}{dt}-\\frac{dz}{dt}+z=0$，即 $\\frac{d^2z}{dt^2}-2\\frac{dz}{dt}+z=0$",
            "特征方程：$r^2-2r+1=0$，$(r-1)^2=0$，得 $r=1$（二重根）",
