      "answer": [
        {
          "label": "用降阶法求解",
          "steps": [
            "令 $u=\\frac{dy}{dx}$，则 $\\frac{du}{dx}=\\frac{d^2y}{dx^2}$",
            "原方程变为：$x\\frac{du}{dx}+u=2x$",
