            "积分因子 $\\mu(x)=e^{\\int\\frac{1}{x}dx}=e^{\\ln x}=x$",
            "两边乘 $x$：$x\\frac{du}{dx}+u=2x$，即 $\\frac{d}{dx}(xu)=2x$",
            "积分：$xu=\\int 2xdx=x^2+C_1$，得 $u=x+\\frac{C_1}{x}$",
            "由 $u=\\frac{dy}{dx}=x+\\frac{C_1}{x}$，积分：$y=\\int\\left(x+\\frac{C_1}{x}\\right)dx=\\frac{x^2}{2}+C_1\\ln x+C_2$",
